      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city’s Heritage Hill Historic District lets drivers glide past preserved 19th‑century homes and a log cabin that tells Burlington’s early settlement story.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
